          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "dbNF4",
              "x": 178,
              "y": 79,
              "name": "军团主窗口",
              "clip": true,
              "width": 756,
              "height": 928,
              "fill": {
                "type": "image",
                "enabled": true,
                "url": "../worldbox_ui_extract/windowBig.png",
                "mode": "stretch"
              },
              "layout": "none",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "MkskX",
                  "x": 664,
                  "y": 16,
                  "name": "关闭按钮底图",
                  "width": 64,
                  "height": 64,
                  "fill": {
                    "type": "image",
                    "enabled": true,
                    "url": "../worldbox_ui_extract/backgroundBackButton.png",
                    "mode": "stretch"
                  },
                  "layout": "none",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nhXHk",
                      "x": 20,
                      "y": 20,
                      "name": "关闭符号",
                      "fill": "#E75B48",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                      "width": 24,
                      "height": 24,
                      "content": "×",
                      "textAlign": "center",
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 20,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lP4gY",
                  "x": 208,
                  "y": 28,
                  "name": "窗口标题",
                  "fill": "#E7B85B",
                  "effect": {
                    "type": "shadow",
                    "shadowType": "outer",
                    "color": "#1A120A99",
                    "offset": {
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": 2
                    },
                    "blur": 2
                  },
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 300,
                  "content": "EraWheel 军团系统",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ACgEr",
                  "x": 88,
                  "y": 206,
                  "name": "介绍标题",
                  "fill": "#E5B960",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 576,
                  "content": "军团系统是什么",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "jc11E",
                  "x": 88,
                  "y": 252,
                  "name": "介绍正文",
                  "fill": "#DDD4BB",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 576,
                  "content": "军团是魔王阵营的波次单位，用来持续给世界施压。\n它不像魔王和将领那样是少数核心，而是负责把前线一直推向玩家王国。\n玩家主要看出波节奏、当前存活数量、同时上限和下一波压力。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.22,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "K8kzkc",
                  "x": 88,
                  "y": 404,
                  "name": "流程标题",
                  "fill": "#E5B960",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 576,
                  "content": "军团什么时候出波",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "l0yxH",
                  "x": 88,
                  "y": 450,
                  "name": "流程正文",
                  "fill": "#DDD4BB",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 576,
                  "content": "1. 预发展：军团关闭，世界只积蓄力量。\n2. 预兆：生成第一波军团，并开始按间隔出波。\n3. 苏醒 / 降临：军团继续按节奏出现，配合将领和魔王压场。\n4. 战后重建：停止出波，并清理本轮军团状态。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.22,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lWGXA",
                  "x": 88,
                  "y": 606,
                  "name": "系统入口标题",
                  "fill": "#E5B960",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 576,
                  "content": "玩家重点看什么",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cAPHC",
                  "x": 88,
                  "y": 652,
                  "name": "系统入口正文",
                  "fill": "#DDD4BB",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 576,
                  "content": "军团数量会随波次递增，但不会突破同时上限。\n每一波军团共享该波随机出来的基础属性，下一波可以不同。\n胜利条件不是清空军团，而是击败本轮最后一名魔王。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.22,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "hdgJM",
                  "x": 59,
                  "y": 95,
                  "name": "军团内容切换标签组",
                  "context": "EraWheel 军团系统顶部内容切换长底座。四枚页签对应：介绍、参数调整、图鉴、运行态。",
                  "width": 633,
                  "height": 111,
                  "fill": {
